# How varied the meadow is, by measure (reports/engine/2026-11-14-meadow-ground, «Что отняло жизнь»), in still air:
# five views of landscape-meadow.bench, each with the meadow's ground painted (`grass parts 193`, mask-<view>), its
# squares of 0.5 m and of 5 m painted (`grass parts 8385`, cells-<view>) and the frame itself (<view>-0).
#   scripts/grass_look.py mask mask-<view>.png m.png
#   scripts/grass_look.py variety m.png cells-<view>.png --light mask-<view>.png <frame of «было»> <view>-0.png
# On game-verge-along, walk-mid (a place of the walk of meadow-walk, the game's camera) and far a ground with its
# own layers is also shown as a painted ground (`grass parts 4096`, <view>-4096): what the layers alone change.
# OPENGOTHIC_GRASS_FINE=0 gives the short sward its broad blades back; OPENGOTHIC_GRASS_BROAD=<percent> (0..100)
# forces the share of the broad blades that stand among the fine ones («Четвёртый круг» of the note). The table of
# «Что отняло жизнь» was made at commit 1a9e32c0d, where this bench took back more parts of that round's look.
#   OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<set> TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 BENCH_HOST=ryzen scripts/bench.sh landscape-meadow-variety
# @timeout 600
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
walkmode run
watch player
cam game
set time 12 0
cloth wind calm

goto NW_TAVERNE_TROLLAREA_03
clear 3000
face wp NW_TAVERNE_TROLLAREA_05
streaming wait
grass wait
wait 5000
grass parts 193
wait 1200
shot mask-meadow-1
wait 200
grass parts 8385
wait 1200
shot cells-meadow-1
wait 200
grass parts 0
wait 1200
shot meadow-1-0
wait 200
grass parts 0
turn 180
wait 2500
grass parts 193
wait 1200
shot mask-meadow-3
wait 200
grass parts 8385
wait 1200
shot cells-meadow-3
wait 200
grass parts 0
wait 1200
shot meadow-3-0
wait 200
grass parts 0
grass stats

